        "text": "<thinking> To implement the password reset flow, I need to choose a concrete external provider. Firebase Authentication is a suitable choice as it provides a password reset mechanism for email accounts. I will use the Firebase Admin SDK to interact with Firebase Authentication. The code will include the import of the Firebase Admin SDK and the use of Firebase-specific functions to initiate the password reset process. </thinking>\n",
