        "text": "<thinking> To create the `refresh_session.py` file that refreshes an expired session or access token, I need to integrate with a concrete external provider. I will use the AWS Cognito service for this task, as it provides a robust solution for handling user sessions and tokens. The code will include the necessary imports and use the Cognito SDK to refresh the session. </thinking>\n",
